# Stickera core

Master doc: `docs/DEVELOPMENT-STANDARDS.md`. Entry: `AGENTS.md` + `.cursorrules`.

## Product (non-negotiable)

- PWA installable (Add to Home Screen); **no app backend**; offline-capable; static `content/` + CDN
- Atomic UI; i18n EN default + PT required; About/signature for portfolio
- Pack: cooldown from config; N stickers per pack; no duplicate IDs in one pack
- Trade: P2P duplicates only — `docs/TRADING-P2P.md`

## Code (when user requests implementation)

- Order: `domain` → `services` → `features` → `components` → `app/`
- No Redux/Firebase without ADR + explicit user request
- Commits only when user asks; Conventional Commits

## Phase

Follow `docs/PHASES/NN-*.md` for current MVP phase gates.
